# This repo publishes exactly one thing: the finished signature pages in
# signature-generator/. Everything else -- the workbook, the build scripts, the
# source artwork -- stays on local disk, so the public repo carries only the
# final HTML.
#
# Safe to do because the pages are self-contained: every image and webfont loads
# from magneticcreative.com, and the only relative links are between the pages
# themselves. Nothing ignored below is needed to serve them.
#
# To keep working on this you still need the ignored files locally --
# build-data.py, signature-generator.js, write-page-urls.py, the .xlsx and
# ../assets. They are NOT backed up by this repo any more, so keep them
# somewhere that is.

# Ignore everything at the root...
/*

# ...then let back in the .gitignore and the published pages.
!/.gitignore
!/signature-generator/
/signature-generator/*
!/signature-generator/*.html

# Never, on any path.
.DS_Store
